{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1496900-squaks-in-the-deep-jumpstart-adventure-\u2018connection-lost\u2019-problems","id":1496900,"title":"[Squaks In the Deep] Jumpstart adventure \u2018Connection Lost\u2019 problems","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-12T01:33:41-08:00","id":1496900,"title":"[Squaks In the Deep] Jumpstart adventure \u2018Connection Lost\u2019 problems","content":"Here are problems with jumpstart adventure <b>\u2018Connection Lost\u2019 </b>- as it's in backer errata phase, I would point to add few sentences to make it's text clearer. WARNING - This topic is clearly spoilers on for 'Connection Lost' - if you are going to play it, not run it - stop reading.<br /> <br /> Scene 0 \u2013<br /> 1. At the start of adventure, PCs get 'two rations apiece' but 'journey takes several days and leads the party deep into the Underneath'. Should not mayor get them more food on the way? Like, possibly, on at least whole journey in one direction?Scene 3 \u2013<br /> <br /> 2. How many Connected Miners are in Camp? Text never points their numbers. Is it should be twice number of PCs?<br /> <br /> 3. Are injured members of first camp with PCs in second camp? Or do they should part the way before finding second camp, with Binton saying they part will return to the Rootsreach?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-13-2022, 04:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T01:58:50-08:00","id":1496970,"title":"","content":"So those are my fan solutions on raisen issues:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1496900-squaks-in-the-deep-jumpstart-adventure-\u2018connection-lost\u2019-problems#post1496900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Scene 0 \u2013<br /> 1. At the start of adventure, PCs get 'two rations apiece'</div> </div> </div> </div>As jouurney takes about week then and back, I just give PCs weeks rations.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1496900-squaks-in-the-deep-jumpstart-adventure-\u2018connection-lost\u2019-problems#post1496900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Scene 3 \u2013<br /> 2. How many Connected Miners are in Camp? Text never points their numbers. Is it should be twice number of PCs?</div> </div> </div> </div>Old Realms of Pugmire tradtion for adventure encounter is <b>'number of enemies equal number of PCs'</b>. In tougher encounter <b>'twice the number of PCs'</b> - I go with <i>TWICE</i> here, as it's mild adventure final scene, i.e. 'big fight'. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1496900-squaks-in-the-deep-jumpstart-adventure-\u2018connection-lost\u2019-problems#post1496900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. Are injured members of first camp with PCs in second camp?</div> </div> </div> </div>I simply made PCs help Binton and the miners to make stretchers and help them start to return to Rootsreach - <b>but once they are on the trail, </b><b>Binton sends PCs to get rest of the miners they suspect are alive</b>, deeper in the mines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-13-2022, 05:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}